## 3. ARCHITECTURAL DECISIONS (ADR)

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **stdlib `"uuid"` (Go {{.GoVersion}})** | Native, no external dep. `uuid.NewV7()` time-sortable. |
| **`SetupBeforeCreate(ctx *Context)`** | Audit (`created_by`) pulled from JWT claims — not duplicated per model. |
| **`scripts/gen_keys.go` (pure Go)** | Portable cross-platform, no openssl. PKCS#8 private + PKIX public → `./secret-auth/`. |
| **SigNoz via `SIGNOZ_DIR=deploy/signoz`** | Isolated folder inside project. Not global. `signoz-init` is idempotent. |
| **`v1.Use(middleware.Authentication)`** | Auth at group level. Auth/health endpoints excluded by being outside protected group. |
| **Per-file per-handler pattern** | Each HTTP handler in its own file (`find.go`, `find-by-id.go`, etc.). |
| **`Filter.Apply(tx *gorm.DB)`** | Composable GORM scopes. `ForCount`/`ForUpdate` flags skip pagination/select. |
| **`Factory` DI pattern** | Single `factory.Factory` wired in `main.go`. No global vars, testable. |
| **`abstraction.Context` wraps {{.Framework}} context** | Carries `Auth`, `Trx`, `Now()`, `PartnerID`, `CountryCode`. |
| **`phuslu/log` strictly JSON** | OTel `trace_id` + `span_id` on every log line. No mixed formats. |
| **`config.AuthKey()` lazy singleton** | `sync.Once` — PEM files read once at first call. `ResetAuthKeyForTesting()` for test suites. |
| **UnixNano timestamps (not `time.Time`)** | `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at` as `int64` BIGINT. |

